('q_bece_soc_2024_31', 'topic_bece_geography', 'subj_bece_social', 'The imaginary line that divides the Earth into Northern and Southern hemispheres is the:', 'multiple_choice', '["A. Prime Meridian", "B. Equator", "C. Tropic of Cancer", "D. Arctic Circle"]', 'B', 'The Equator divides Earth into northern and southern halves.', 'easy', 1, 60),
